  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ある特定の　ポケモンを進化させる　不思議な金属。いくつもの層が　重なっている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "어느 특정 포켓몬을 진화시키는 이상한 금속. 여러 겹으로 겹쳐져 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能讓特定寶可夢進化的神奇金屬。由許多的層次堆疊而成。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un morceau de métal étrange qui permet de faire évoluer une certaine espèce de Pokémon. Il est composé de plusieurs couches.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses besondere Metall löst bei einem bestimmten Pokémon die Entwicklung aus. Es besteht aus einer Vielzahl an übereinanderliegenden Schichten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Curioso metal que hace evolucionar a una determinada especie de Pokémon. Está formado por distintas capas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Metallo particolare che fa evolvere determinate specie di Pokémon. È composto da vari strati.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A peculiar metal that can make certain species of Pokémon evolve. It is composed of many layers.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ある特定の　ポケモンを進化させる　不思議な金属。いくつもの層が　重なっている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能让某些特定宝可梦进化的神奇金属。由多个层次叠加而成。",
